MiraViewer export modifications:
- Split inference into image encoder, prompt/mask decoder, memory encoder,
  and memory-attention ONNX graphs using opset 17.
- Express complex rotary position operations as real-valued arithmetic.
- Store model-only spatial and learned temporal positions separately as
  little-endian Float32 tensors. No MRI values are part of these tensors.
- Preserve the checkpoint parameters without fine-tuning.

Citation: Yunyang Xiong et al., Efficient Track Anything, 2024,
arXiv:2411.18933. https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.18933
