EfficientSAM, SAM2-Video-Predictor, and florence-sam.

These are general single-object tracking assets, not a four-class tumor
model or an independent anatomical reference. Byte verification establishes
asset identity only, not clinical accuracy, runtime fit, or browser speed.
Distribute only the six model files listed in the application manifest and
these notices. Do not include image inputs, prompts, or prediction outputs.
